DLC_Dat["Murkmire"]={}
DLC_Dat["Murkmire"].name="Murkmire"
DLC_Dat["Murkmire"].dat={
2292, -- Defender of Murkmire,  Defeat both world bosses in Murkmire.
2293, -- Fiend of the Fens,  Defeat the necromancer Baxilt-Gah at Bok-Xul.
2294, -- Feller of Thunder,  Defeat the miregaunt Walks-Like-Thunder at the Echoing Hollow.
2321, -- Those Who Swallow Seasons,  Defeat the four miregaunts who have swallowed Xinchei-Konu tablets.
2330, -- Surreptitiously Shadowed,  Get to know the Shadowscale with peculiar interest in your activities in Murkmire.
2331, -- Hero of Murkmire,  Complete quests, defeat bosses, and explore delves to become the Hero of Murkmire.
2333, -- Traps and Treasures,  Complete the "Sunken Treasure" quest.
2334, -- Seeker of the Lost,  Complete the "Missing in Murkmire" quest.
2335, -- Mysteries of the Remnant,  Complete the "Whispers in the Wood" quest.
2336, -- Sap-Sleeper,  Complete the "Death and Dreaming" quest.
2337, -- Shadows of the Past,  Complete the "The Swamp and the Serpent" quest.
2338, -- To Chase a Dream,  Complete the "The Remnant of Argon" quest.
2339, -- The River of Rebirth,  Complete the "By River and Root" quest.
2343, -- Fiendish Flora,  Harvest a Scuttle Bloom and disarm a Gas Blossom, Static Pitcher, Catapult Cabbage, and Lantern Mantis.
2353, -- The Progeny,  Help the Bright-Throats assure the future of their tribe.
2354, -- Cold-Blood, Warm Heart,  Help the Dead-Water follow their chosen path.
2355, -- Friend of Murkmire,  Befriend the Bright-Throat, Dead-Water, and Root-Whisper tribes by offering them aid in times of need.
2362, -- Blackrose Prison Vanquisher,  Defeat Battlemage Ennodius, Tames-the-Beast, Lady Minara, and Drakeeh the Unchained in Blackrose Prison.
2363, -- Blackrose Prison Conqueror,  Defeat Battlemage Ennodius, Tames-the-Beast, Lady Minara, and Drakeeh the Unchained in Veteran Blackrose Prison.
2364, -- Sigil Stingy,  Defeat Battlemage Ennodius, Tames-the-Beast, Lady Minara, and Drakeeh the Unchained in Veteran Blackrose Prison without using Sigils during combat.
2365, -- Unchained and Undying,  Defeat Battlemage Ennodius, Tames-the-Beast, Lady Minara, and Drakeeh the Unchained in Veteran Blackrose Prison without dying.
2366, -- Gauntlet Gallop,  Defeat Battlemage Ennodius, Tames-the-Beast, Lady Minara, and Drakeeh the Unchained in Veteran Blackrose Prison in under 30 minutes. The timer starts when the first arena begins.
2367, -- Blackrose Buccaneer,  Defeat Battlemage Ennodius, Tames-the-Beast, Lady Minara, and Drakeeh the Unchained in Veteran Blackrose Prison in under 40 minutes without dying. The timer starts when the first arena begins.
2368, -- God of the Gauntlet,  Defeat Battlemage Ennodius, Tames-the-Beast, Lady Minara, and Drakeeh the Unchained in Veteran Blackrose Prison in under 40 minutes without dying and without activating Sigils during combat. The timer starts when the first arena begins.
2369, -- Faster than Flames,  Defeat Battlemage Ennodius without group members taking flame damage while her Flame Spouts ability is active in Veteran Blackrose Prison.
2370, -- Rarely Rooted,  Defeat Tames-the-Beast without a group member becoming trapped by the Crushing Roots ability in Veteran Blackrose Prison.
2371, -- Skeletal Summoning,  Defeat Lady Minara after three Bone Colossi are summoned within 30 seconds of the round beginning in Veteran Blackrose Prison.
2372, -- A Thrilling Trifecta,  Defeat Battlemage Ennodius, Lady Minara, and Tames-the-Beast within 20 seconds of each other in Veteran Blackrose Prison.
2373, -- Spirits Sundered,  Defeat Drakeeh the Unchained while always ensuring he absorbs at least 2 spirits before casting Spirit Scream in Veteran Blackrose Prison.
2374, -- Meteor Mayhem,  Use Battlemage Ennodius' Meteor ability to stun all four atronachs simultaneously in the first arena of Blackrose Prison.
2375, -- Rise of the Fallen,  Use a Sigil of Resurrection in any arena to revive three other group members at once in Blackrose Prison.
2376, -- Cleansing the Damned,  Have a single group member successfully absorb at least three of Drakeeh's targets during his Spirit Ignition ability and cleanse themselves without dying.
}
